    "https://ejgl.fa.ap1.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/UOW/job/7141": {
      "title": "External Member, University Council",
      "description": "External Member, University Council - University of Wollongong Careers Skip to main content. sitemap Profile Sign Out View More Jobs External Member, University Council Wollongong, NSW, Australia Job Description Expression of Interest External Member, University Council University of Wollongong The University of Wollongong (UOW) is seeking expressions of interest from experienced leaders to join the University's governing body as a Council-appointed External Member. This is an opportunity to contribute to the governance and future success of one of Australia's leading universities. Council is responsible for the strategic oversight, performance, financial sustainability, risk management and governance of the University, ensuring UOW continues to deliver positive outcomes for students, staff, research partners and the broader community. UOW is particularly interested in candidates who bring expertise in one or more of the following areas: Digital, Data and Technology Governance People, Culture and Organisational Capability Innovation, Enterprise and Future Readiness Commercial Expertise While experience within the higher education sector is welcomed, applications are encouraged from individuals who have developed their expertise across a range of industries and sectors. The Role As a member of Council, you will contribute to: Strategic oversight and long-term planning Governance, stewardship and accountability Financial and risk oversight Major institutional decisions Advancement of the University's mission and strategic objectives Council members are expected to exercise independent judgement, contribute constructively to discussions and act in the best interests of the University. About You Candidates should be able to demonstrate: Significant governance, board or executive leadership experience Sound judgement and strategic thinking Experience operating within complex organisations Strong understanding of accountability, stewardship and risk Ability to contribute effectively within a governing body environment Commitment to ethical leadership and public purpose The University welcomes applications from individuals with diverse professional, cultural and community backgrounds. Time Commitment Council members are expected to: Attend approximately six Council meetings per year Participate in one or more Council Committees as required Undertake meeting preparation and occasional University engagement activities Further information regarding time commitments will be provided to shortlisted candidates. How to Apply To express your interest, please submit: A cover letter outlining your interest, relevant experience, and a brief statement addressing the capability area(s) relevant to your experience A current curriculum vitae Applications close 11.55pm Sunday 15 November 2026 . For a confidential discussion regarding the opportunity, please contact Marcia Sherlock on 02 4221 5923. Apply Now Job Info Job Identification 7141 Posting Date 10/30/2026, 12:13 AM Apply Before 11/15/2026, 04:55 AM Locations Wollongong, NSW, Australia © MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors Legend Jobs at a location Group of locations © MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors | © Oracle Corporation Terms Legal Notices Use command and scroll to zoom the map Use two fingers to move the map Wollongong, NSW, Australia Copy to Clipboard Similar Jobs Contact Us Feedback Privacy Statement and Policies Contact Us Feedback Privacy Statement and Policies UOW Home Page Why work at UOW UOW Global Presence UOW in Dubai UOW in Hong Kong UOW in Malaysia Our People UOW Pulse I am an employee Are You Still With Us? It seems you've been gone for a while. For security reasons we will end your session automatically in 03:00 unless you would like to continue working. End Session Continue Working Work Summary This summary is generated by AI Assist. Click inside the summary text box to make changes as necessary. 1000 Required Discard Add Summary Page External Member, University Council - University of Wollongong Careers loaded"
